se,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "No need to decide, it keeps me at ease."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "I float in uncertainty, in the unforeseen,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "I like to keep all options, even after midnight."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}